TITLE Transport viscosity question
SOLUTION 0-10
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
SOLUTION 1
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
EXCHANGE_SPECIES
    X- = X-
        log_k 0.0
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -lengths 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step cell visc
    -start
    10 PUNCH KIN_TIME, CELL_NO, VISCOSITY
    -end
END